# Onar's north field after step B of reports/content/2026-11-19-crop-fields/alive.md: the wind's waves shown by the
# field's light and the depth shade of a wall of rye (anchor "field" of the foliage record). Three cameras of
# crop-onar-alive.bench for the pairs «шаг А | шаг Б» and two clips of a gust.
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> scripts/bench.sh crop-onar-wave <out>
# @timeout 600
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode walk
watch player
goto pos 57094 1850 -11100
cam at 57600 2160 -9800 58600 2060 -8600
clear 3000
wait 15000
grass wait
wait 2000
shot edge
wait 300
cam at 55400 2300 -10000 59000 2050 -8000
wait 6000
shot corner
wait 300
cam at 58640 2230 -10350 58900 2150 -8800
wait 6000
shot wall
wait 300
# clip 1: a gust over two strips of rye, from 8 m over the plot's south end, along the strips
cam at 59700 2950 -11400 59700 2150 -8600
foliage wait-gust 4000 -9500
rec gust-over
wait 14000
stop
wait 500
# clip 2: the next gust at the wall of rye, the eye's height
cam at 58640 2230 -10350 58900 2150 -8800
foliage wait-gust 4000 -9500
rec gust-wall
wait 12000
stop
wait 500
